      // ── AQA GCSE Mathematics 8300 (level: gcse) — generated by _build script from the official AQA assessment-resources PDFs.
      // Print-only like every Maths paper. Papers carrying questions + markSchemes
      // were transcribed from the official QP/MS (wording paraphrased) and are
