              '8(a)(i)': { type: 'points', points: ['four polypeptide chains / subunits / haem groups / Fe²⁺ (1) — accept 2 alpha and 2 beta chains / subunits', 'haem groups combine / bind (reversibly) with oxygen (molecules) (1) — accept iron combines / binds with oxygen', 'so can pick up four molecules of oxygen (1)', 'co-operative binding occurs (1)', 'because after the first molecule of oxygen binds, the (3D) shape of the molecule changes (1) — accept description, e.g. after the first molecule of oxygen binds other oxygen molecules can be picked up more easily / there is a higher affinity for oxygen'], guidance: '3 marks: any three of the five points.' },
