              '05.1': { type: 'points', points: ['(Enthalpy change = lattice dissociation energy + hydration energies of ions) M1 Enthalpy change = +2237 – (2 x 364) – 1650', 'M2 = – 141 kJ mol⁻¹'], guidance: '2 marks (AO2 ×2).' },
