              '06.5': { type: 'points', points: ['M1 n Ba(OH)₂ in 25 cm³ = 0.952/(171.3 x 10) = 5.56 x 10⁻⁴ mol', 'M2 n HCl in 24.5 cm³ = 2 x 5.56 x 10⁻⁴ = 0.00111 mol', 'M3 Concentration of HCl = (0.00111 × 1000)/24.50 = 0.045 mol dm⁻³'], guidance: '3 marks (AO2 ×3). M2 = M1 x 2 M3 = (M2 × 1000)/(24.50)' },
