              '07.2': { type: 'points', points: ['Al₂(SO₄)₃+ 12 H₂O → 2 [Al(H₂O)₆]³⁺+ 3 SO₄²⁻'], guidance: '1 mark (AO1). Allow [Al(H₂O)₆]₂(SO₄)₃' },
              '07.3': { type: 'points', points: ['M1 Al³⁺ has a high charge and small size OR Al³⁺ has a high charge density', 'M2 Al³⁺ weakens the O-H bond (in water ligands and donates H⁺to water or forms H₃O⁺ ions with water)'], guidance: '2 marks (AO1 ×2). M2 Al³⁺ attracts electrons from the O-H bond (in the ligand and releases H⁺or H₃O⁺ ions) OR Al³⁺ polarises the O-H bond/water molecule' },
