              '04.5': { type: 'points', points: ['M1 (at start) n(NaOH) = 2.00/40 = 0.05 (mol) and n(CH₃COOH) = (500 × 1.0)/1000 = 0.5 (mol)', 'M2 (after adding NaOH) n(CH₃COOH) = (0.50 – 0.05) = 0.45 (mol)', 'M3 n(CH₃COO⁻) = (n NaOH) = 0.05 (mol)', 'M4 [H⁺] = (Ka × [CH₃COOH])/[CH₃COO⁻] or (1.74 × 10⁻⁵ × 0.9)/0.1 or (1.74 × 10⁻⁵ × 0.45/V)/(0.05/V) = 1.57 × 10⁻⁴ (mol dm⁻³)', 'M5 pH = 3.80'], guidance: '5 marks (AO2). M3 = n(NaOH) from M1 M4 = (1.74 × 10⁻⁵ × M2)/(M3) V cancels out so not needed in this expression answer to 2 decimal places M5 allow 3.81 allow pH = – log M4' },
