              '01.8': { type: 'points', points: ['M1 Nucleophilic addition', 'M2 arrow from lone pair on C of :CN⁻ to C of C=O [drawn]', 'M3 arrow from double bond to O (dependent on an attempt at M2)', 'M4 for intermediate with –ve on O [drawn]', 'M5 arrow from lone pair (on O⁻) to H⁺'], guidance: '5 marks (AO1 ×1; AO2 ×4). ALLOW negative charge anywhere on cyanide But attacking lone pair must be on C Do not award M3 without attempt of M2 Allow M2 for attack to a positive carbon following breaking of C=O Penalise covalent KCN in M2 M3 ignore partial charges unless wrong Penalise M3 for incorrect connection between CN and C NB Allow fully displayed or other structural formulae [Mechanism drawn: butanone + :CN⁻, then protonation by H⁺.]' },
