              '31(a)': { type: 'points', points: ['Expression: (84 x 0.56) + (86 x 9.86) + (87 x 7.00) + (88 x 82.58) /100 (47.04 + 847.96 + 609.00 + 7267.04)/100 = 8771.04 8771.04 / 100', 'Evaluation and sf: = 87.71'], guidance: '2 marks (AO1.2 (x2)). Answer line: If answer is 87.71, award 2 marks.' },
