              '2(b)': {"type":"points","points":["Knowledge: Efficiency will decrease","Knowledge: Inefficient allocation of resources","Knowledge: Not productively efficient","Analysis: Not producing at maximum potential output","Analysis: Potentially produce more wheat and oats","Analysis: Spare capacity","Analysis: Unemployed resources","Analysis: Lower output the next year","Analysis: No opportunity cost from moving from W towards PPF"],"guidance":"2 marks: Knowledge 1, Analysis 1. Knowledge: 1 mark for understanding, e.g. Analysis: 1 mark for e.g."},
