              '2(b)': {"type":"points","points":["Application: 5% x 0.63 (1) OR","Application: 5% x -0.63 (1) OR Answer = 3.15% Award 2 marks for correct answer (accept any in the range of 3 to 3.2)"],"guidance":"2 marks: Application 2. Application: 1 mark for likely understanding e.g."},
